WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.196
The lamb was hopping and skipping.

2
00:00:05.197 --> 00:00:09.150
It did not see the fox.

3
00:00:09.151 --> 00:00:12.460
"We must warn Kep," Benjamin said.

4
00:00:12.461 --> 00:00:15.624
"Let's run across the field."

5
00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:18.169
Peter looked at the fox.

6
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:23.390
He was creeping toward the lamb.

7
00:00:23.391 --> 00:00:26.731
"We don't have time," Peter said.

8
00:00:26.732 --> 00:00:30.139
Peter jumped out of the tall grass.

9
00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:34.816
"Tag!" he cried. "You're it!"

10
00:00:34.817 --> 00:00:38.635
"Baa!" the lamb cried happily.

11
00:00:38.636 --> 00:00:43.712
It skipped toward the bunnies.

12
00:00:43.713 --> 00:00:46.916
"Hey!" The fox yelled at Peter.

13
00:00:46.917 --> 00:01:00.691
"That lamb is my lunch!"

14
00:01:00.692 --> 00:01:06.473
Then the fox ran toward the bunnies.

15
00:01:06.474 --> 00:01:08.700
"I know," he said.

16
00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:19.751
"I'll eat rabbits for lunch!"

17
00:01:19.752 --> 00:01:26.098
Peter and Benjamin ran.

18
00:01:26.099 --> 00:01:30.501
They zigged and zagged through the field.

19
00:01:30.502 --> 00:01:33.887
They ran as fast as they could.

20
00:01:33.888 --> 00:01:38.770
But the fox ran fast too.

21
00:01:38.771 --> 00:01:42.744
Suddenly he leaped at Peter!

22
00:01:42.745 --> 00:01:48.303
"Ahh!" Peter cried.

